markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>The Four-Part Prompt Framework</h1>

AI pays attention to four things in a prompt:
- The Task (what to build)
- The Context (who it's for or what it's about)
- The Tone/Format (the style or feel)
- The Details (specific content to include).

A strong prompt hits all four. A generic-looking result is almost always missing one of them, not a sign the AI misunderstood or isn't capable.

That reframe matters for how you coach students through the AI Design Challenges. When a page comes back bland, the fix usually isn't "try again," it's figuring out which of the four pieces to add.

